, "recid": "23778983", "revision": 4, "files": [{"id": "3eb36139-7544-45a6-9b08-e90b36e2ae26", "key": "Cloud_Microservices_Zenodo_v4.2_FINAL.zip", "size": 49895391, "checksum": "md5:5c2ac05f18ece2c5bb81ba3850bfecbc", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23778983/files/Cloud_Microservices_Zenodo_v4.2_FINAL.zip/content"}}], "swh": null, "owners": [{"id": "58925"}], "status": "published", "stats": {"downloads": 8, "unique_downloads": 8, "views": 37, "unique_views": 36, "version_downloads": 3, "version_unique_downloads": 3, "version_unique_views": 8, "version_views": 8}, "state": "done", "submitted": true}, {"created": "2026-10-30T14:43:38.560211+00:00", "modified": "2026-10-30T14:43:38.861865+00:00", "id": 23809273, "conceptrecid": "23809272", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23809273", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.23809272", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23809273", "metadata": {"title": "Computing replication package: Auditing Class Rebalancing and Decision Thresholds in Software Defect Prediction under Feature-Group Separation", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23809273", "publication_date": "2026-10-30", "description": "<p>This record contains the replication materials accompanying the manuscript &ldquo;Auditing Class Rebalancing and Decision Thresholds in Software Defect Prediction under Feature-Group Separation.&rdquo;</p>\n<p>The package provides the analysis code, aggregate and fold-level results, provenance manifests, experimental protocols, source transformations, saved verification outputs, and an independent verification script. The study evaluates five NASA PROMISE datasets and a deterministic external cohort of 18 Apache projects using logistic regression and random forest with no rebalancing, class weighting, and SMOTE under conventional and exact-feature-grouped evaluation.</p>\n<p>The package supports verification of fold-to-project aggregation, project-level contrasts, exact sign-flip tests, Holm corrections, and descriptive bootstrap intervals. The 18 external projects belong to a common Apache data lineage and are not treated as 18 independent organizations.</p>\n<p>Third-party NASA/PROMISE and IND-JLMIV+R raw feature tables, per-record labels and predictions, and exact feature-group identifiers are not redistributed. Therefore, this is an auditable compact evidence package rather than a complete end-to-end replay archive. Users should obtain third-party inputs from the cited sources and follow their original terms.</p>\n<p>Original code, aggregate evidence, manifests, protocols, and documentation are released under CC BY 4.0. Third-party materials retain their original terms.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Wang, Fengqi", "affiliation": "Hubei University"}], "keywords": ["software defect prediction", "class imbalance", "SMOTE", "decision threshold", "feature-group separation", "reproducibility", "empirical software engineering", "machine learning"], "version": "1.0.0", "language": "eng", "custom": {"code:programmingLanguage": [{"id": "python", "title": {"en": "Python"}}]}, "resource_type": {"title": "Software", "type": "software"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "23809272"}}]}}, "title": "Computing replication package: Auditing Class Rebalancing and Decision Thresholds in Software Defect Prediction under Feature-Group Separation", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23809273", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23809273", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23809273?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23809273", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23809273", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.23809273", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23809273/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23809272", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23809272", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/1