ion manager, and the executable scenarios (E-site, traffic, and optional SUMO and Mesa bindings). Running python3 tools/run_evaluation.py (Python 3.9 or later, standard library only) reproduces the evaluation and re-checks every reported result. The SUMO and Mesa studies run when these tools are installed (tested with SUMO 1.27.1 and Mesa 3.3.1 on Python 3.13).</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Weber, Sebastian", "affiliation": "FZI Research Center for Information Technology", "orcid": "0009-0006-3746-0694"}, {"name": "Weber, Thomas", "affiliation": "Karlsruhe Institute of Technology", "orcid": "0009-0001-5775-2225"}, {"name": "Lange, Arne", "affiliation": "University of Mannheim", "orcid": "0000-0002-1776-0247"}, {"name": "Cederbladh, Johan", "affiliation": "Volvo Construction Equipment", "orcid": "0000-0003-2021-8341"}, {"name": "Krems, Daniel", "affiliation": "Anstalt f\u00fcr Verbrennungskraftmaschinen List (Austria)", "orcid": "0009-0007-6444-8604"}, {"name": "Henss, J\u00f6rg", "affiliation": "FZI Research Center for Information Technology", "orcid": "0000-0002-4527-211X"}, {"name": "Scheerer, Max", "affiliation": "FZI Research Center for Information Technology", "orcid": "0000-0001-9074-254X"}, {"name": "Heinrich, Robert", "affiliation": "Universit\u00e4t Ulm", "orcid": "0000-0003-0779-9444"}, {"name": "Reussner, Ralf", "affiliation": "Karlsruhe Institute of Technology", "orcid": "0000-0002-9308-6290"}], "keywords": ["multi-level simulation", "switching policy", "policy specification", "metamodel", "OCL", "self-adaptive systems", "simulation orchestration", "SUMO", "Mesa"], "version": "1.0", "language": "eng", "resource_type": {"title": "Software", "type": "software"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "grants": [{"code": "101139789", "internal_id": "10.13039/501100000780::101139789", "funder": {"name": "European Commission", "doi": "10.13039/501100000780", "acronym": "EC"}, "title": "Hardware Abstraction Layer for a European Software Defined Vehicle approach", "acronym": "HAL4SDV", "program": "HORIZON.2.4", "url": "https://cordis.europa.eu/projects/101139789", "doi": "10.3030/101139789"}, {"code": "499241390", "internal_id": "018mejw64::499241390", "funder": {"name": "Deutsche Forschungsgemeinschaft"}, "title": "FeCoMASS"}, {"code": "501798263", "internal_id": "018mejw64::501798263", "funder": {"name": "Deutsche Forschungsgemeinschaft"}, "title": "SFB 1608"}], "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "23804086"}}]}}, "title": "Replication package for \"Cross-domain Specification of Switching Policies in Multi-level Simulation\"", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23804087", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23804087", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23804087?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23804087", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23804087", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.23804087", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23804087/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23804086", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23804086", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23804086", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.23804086", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23804087/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23804087/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23804087/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23804087/media-files", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23804087/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23804087/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23804087/versions", "draft": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23804087/draft", "access_links": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23804087/access/links", "access_grants": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23804087/access/gr